# Example only. Replace 192.0.2.1 with the LAN address that should serve AuraLAN.
# 192.0.2.0/24 is reserved for documentation and is not intended for production use.
# AuraLAN itself listens on localhost:8787; Caddy provides the clean LAN URL.

http://192.0.2.1 {
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8787
}
